---
import RunComparisonMock from './RunComparisonMock.astro';
---

<main class="recorder-page">
    <section class="recorder-hero recorder-wrap">
      <div class="recorder-copy">
        <p class="recorder-index">01 / VERIFY THE WORK</p>
        <h1>Catch broken agent workflows <em>before they ship.</em></h1>
        <p>
          Dynobox is the open-source test runner for SKILL.md and agent
          workflows. Run them across supported harnesses and check observed
          tool calls, commands, and work-directory artifacts with explicit
          assertions.
        </p>
        <p>
          Find skipped steps, bad outputs, and behavior regressions, with
          captured evidence for failed assertions.
        </p>
        <div class="recorder-actions">
          <a href="https://docs.dynobox.xyz/getting-started">View docs <span>→</span></a>
          <code><span>$</span> npx dynobox init</code>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="recorder-terminal" aria-label="Dynobox run output for the dyno-from-skill skill">
        <figcaption>
          <div><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          <span>~/skills/dyno-from-skill</span>
        </figcaption>
        <div class="recorder-terminal-output">
          <p><span class="is-prompt">❯</span> <b>npx dynobox run dyno/dyno-from-skill.dyno.mjs</b></p>
          <div class="recorder-terminal-header">
            <p><span class="is-brand">■ dynobox</span>&nbsp; <span class="is-muted">0.10.0</span></p>
            <p class="is-muted">discovered 1 dyno · 1 scenario · harnesses: 2</p>
          </div>
          <div class="recorder-terminal-results">
            <p class="is-suite">[dyno-from-skill] generates test dyno</p>
            <p class="is-scenario">create dyno from skill</p>
            <p class="is-job"><span>claude-code/sonnet/da...</span><b><i>✓</i> 13 assertions</b><time>1m27s</time></p>
            <div class="recorder-terminal-details">
              <p class="is-check"><i>✓</i><code>skill.referenced(dyno-from-skill)</code></p>
              <p class="is-check"><i>✓</i><code>artifact.exists(wordcount.dyno.mjs)</code></p>
              <p class="is-check"><i>✓</i><code>verify.command(dynobox validate)</code></p>
              <p class="is-more">…</p>
            </div>
            <p class="is-job"><span>codex/gpt-5.4-mini/da...</span><b><i>✓</i> 13 assertions</b><time>1m58s</time></p>
          </div>
          <div class="recorder-terminal-summary">
            <hr />
            <strong><i>✓ 2 jobs passed</i> · 26 assertions · <span>3m25s</span></strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="recorder-principle">
      <div class="recorder-wrap">
        <p class="recorder-index">02 / EVIDENCE OVER OPINION</p>
        <div class="recorder-principle-head">
          <h2>Behavior is the contract.</h2>
          <p>
            Agents are non-deterministic. Your acceptance criteria shouldn't
            be. Define what must happen, then evaluate captured evidence on each run.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="recorder-contract">
          <article><span>OBSERVE</span><h3>What the agent did</h3><p>Tool calls, normalized commands, work-directory artifacts, skills, transcript, and final response.</p></article>
          <i>→</i>
          <article><span>ASSERT</span><h3>What the test requires</h3><p>Explicit matchers authored in TypeScript or YAML and compiled before the harness runs.</p></article>
          <i>→</i>
          <article><span>EXPLAIN</span><h3>Why it passed or failed</h3><p>Evaluator-recorded evidence attached to assertion results for inspection and comparison.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="recorder-assertions recorder-wrap">
      <header>
        <p class="recorder-index">03 / DEFINE THE CHECKS</p>
        <h2>Turn instructions<br />into checks.</h2>
        <p class="recorder-assertions-intro">
          A dyno translates skill requirements into deterministic assertions.
          Each result connects a requirement to evidence captured during the run.
        </p>
        <a class="recorder-text-link" href="https://docs.dynobox.xyz/config-authoring/#assertions">Read the assertion reference <span>→</span></a>
      </header>
      <div class="recorder-check-table" role="region" aria-label="Assertion checks" tabindex="0">
        <table>
          <caption>Assertion checks and observed evidence</caption>
          <colgroup>
            <col class="is-check" />
            <col class="is-proof" />
            <col class="is-evidence" />
            <col class="is-status" />
          </colgroup>
          <thead>
            <tr><th scope="col">CHECK</th><th scope="col">WHAT IT CHECKS</th><th scope="col">OBSERVED EVIDENCE</th><th scope="col">STATUS</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><code>skill.referenced</code></td><td>Observe a dyno authoring skill reference</td><td>dyno-from-skill / SKILL.md</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>http.called</code></td><td>Observe the authoring reference request</td><td>config-authoring.md · status 200</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>artifact.exists</code></td><td>Find the generated dyno in the work directory</td><td>dyno / wordcount.dyno.mjs</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>artifact.contains</code></td><td>Find the Dynobox SDK import</td><td>defineDyno · @dynobox/sdk</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>command.notCalled</code></td><td>Observe no command that runs the dyno</td><td>no dynobox run observed</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
            <tr><td><code>verify.command</code></td><td>Check that validation exits successfully</td><td>dynobox validate · exit 0</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="recorder-history">
      <div class="recorder-wrap">
        <header class="recorder-history-copy">
          <p class="recorder-index">04 / BUILD A RECORD</p>
          <h2>See when an assertion outcome changed.</h2>
          <p>
            Compare compatible jobs across saved runs and inspect assertion
            outcome and evidence changes.
          </p>
          <a class="recorder-text-link" href="https://dash.dynobox.xyz">Open the dashboard <span>↗</span></a>
        </header>

        <RunComparisonMock />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="recorder-close">
      <div><span></span><p>READY TO VERIFY</p></div>
      <h2>Trust the agent.<br /><em>Verify the work.</em></h2>
      <a href="https://docs.dynobox.xyz/getting-started">Get started <span>→</span></a>
      <footer>
        <code>npm install -g dynobox</code>
        <nav aria-label="Footer">
          <a href="https://x.com/dynoboxdotxyz">@dynoboxdotxyz</a>
          <a href="mailto:inbox@dynobox.xyz">inbox@dynobox.xyz</a>
          <a class="recorder-mobile-resource" href="https://github.com/dynobox/dynobox" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a>
          <a class="recorder-mobile-resource" href="https://www.skills.sh/dynobox/skills" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Skills</a>
          <a class="recorder-mobile-resource" href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/dynobox" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">npm</a>
        </nav>
        <p>OPEN SOURCE · BUILT FOR DEVELOPERS</p>
      </footer>
    </section>
  </main>

<style>
  .recorder-page {
    --paper: #fff;
    --ink: #090909;
    --paper-muted: #626262;
    --paper-line: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    --signal: #ec402d;
    --dark: #090909;
    --dark-line: #2d2d2d;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100vw;
    overflow: clip;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 49.96%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.035) 50%, transparent 50.04%),
      var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .recorder-wrap {
    width: min(1320px, calc(100% - 76px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .recorder-close > div > span {
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    background: var(--signal);
  }

  .recorder-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.92fr) minmax(500px, 1.08fr);
    gap: clamp(60px, 9vw, 140px);
    align-items: center;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
    padding-block: 108px 128px;
  }

  .recorder-index {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: var(--signal);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .recorder-copy h1,
  .recorder-principle h2,
  .recorder-assertions h2,
  .recorder-history-copy h2,
  .recorder-close h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .recorder-copy h1 {
    font-size: clamp(48px, 5.6vw, 84px);
    line-height: 0.9;
  }

  .recorder-copy h1 em,
  .recorder-close h2 em {
    color: var(--signal);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .recorder-copy > p:not(.recorder-index) {
    max-width: 610px;
    margin: 34px 0 0;
    color: #414141;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .recorder-copy > p:not(.recorder-index) + p {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .recorder-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 22px 28px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .recorder-actions a,
  .recorder-close > a {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
    min-width: 180px;
    padding: 13px 15px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background-color 160ms ease,
      transform 160ms ease;
  }

  .recorder-actions a:hover,
  .recorder-close > a:hover {
    background: #262626;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .recorder-actions a:focus-visible,
  .recorder-close > a:focus-visible,
  .recorder-text-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--signal);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .recorder-actions a span,
  .recorder-close > a span {
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .recorder-actions code {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 43px;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    background: #f7f7f7;
    color: var(--paper-muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .recorder-actions code span {
    margin-right: 9px;
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .recorder-terminal {
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #292929;
    background: var(--dark);
    color: #f5f5f5;
    box-shadow: 18px 20px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .recorder-terminal figcaption {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-height: 43px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--dark-line);
    background: #111;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .recorder-terminal figcaption div {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .recorder-terminal figcaption i {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #3c3c3c;
  }

  .recorder-terminal figcaption i:first-child {
    background: var(--signal);
  }

  .recorder-terminal-output {
    min-height: 365px;
    padding: 24px 20px 22px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-size: clamp(11px, 0.9vw, 13px);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-output p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-output .is-prompt,
  .recorder-terminal-output .is-brand {
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .recorder-terminal-output b {
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-output .is-muted,
  .recorder-terminal-output time,
  .recorder-terminal-summary span {
    color: #777;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-header {
    margin-top: 17px;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-header p {
    padding-left: 2ch;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-results {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-results .is-suite {
    color: #ff5746;
    padding-left: 2ch;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-results .is-scenario {
    padding-left: 4ch;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-results .is-job {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 24ch 1fr auto;
    gap: 14px;
    min-width: 57ch;
    padding-left: 6ch;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-results .is-job > span {
    color: #888;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-details {
    margin-block: 3px 6px;
    min-width: 57ch;
    padding-left: 8ch;
    color: #aaa;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-details .is-check {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5ch minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1ch;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-details .is-check code {
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #a4a4a4;
    font: inherit;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-details .is-more {
    padding-left: 2.5ch;
    color: #666;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-output i {
    color: #65c782;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-summary {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-summary hr {
    margin: 0;
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #343434;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-summary strong {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding-left: 2ch;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .recorder-terminal-summary strong i {
    color: #65c782;
  }

  .recorder-principle {
    padding-block: 120px 130px;
    background: var(--dark);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .recorder-principle-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(320px, 0.8fr);
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .recorder-principle h2,
  .recorder-assertions h2,
  .recorder-history-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 82px);
    line-height: 0.95;
  }

  .recorder-principle-head > p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #aaa;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .recorder-contract {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 36px 1fr 36px 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: stretch;
    margin-top: 80px;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--dark-line);
  }

  .recorder-contract article {
    padding: 28px 10px;
  }

  .recorder-contract article span {
    color: var(--signal);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .recorder-contract h3 {
    margin: 42px 0 10px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .recorder-contract p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #929292;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .recorder-contract > i {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: #777;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .recorder-assertions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(290px, 0.55fr) minmax(600px, 1.45fr);
    gap: clamp(60px, 9vw, 130px);
    align-items: start;
    padding-block: 130px 150px;
  }

  .recorder-assertions > header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 140px;
  }

  .recorder-assertions-intro {
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: #555;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .recorder-check-table {
    margin-top: 43px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .recorder-check-table table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }

  .recorder-check-table caption {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  .recorder-check-table col.is-check {
    width: 22%;
  }

  .recorder-check-table col.is-proof {
    width: 34%;
  }

  .recorder-check-table col.is-evidence {
    width: 34%;
  }

  .recorder-check-table col.is-status {
    width: 10%;
  }

  .recorder-check-table th,
  .recorder-check-table td {
    padding: 15px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .recorder-check-table th + th,
  .recorder-check-table td + td {
    padding-left: 18px;
  }

  .recorder-check-table th {
    color: var(--paper-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .recorder-check-table code {
    color: #555;
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .recorder-check-table td:nth-child(2) {
    color: #222;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .recorder-check-table td:nth-child(3) {
    color: #666;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .recorder-check-table th:last-child,
  .recorder-check-table td:last-child {
    padding-left: 8px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .recorder-check-table td:last-child {
    color: #397c52;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .recorder-text-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    color: inherit;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }

  .recorder-text-link:hover {
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .recorder-history {
    padding-block: 130px 150px;
    background: var(--dark);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .recorder-history > .recorder-wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 0.58fr) minmax(620px, 1.42fr);
    gap: clamp(60px, 9vw, 130px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .recorder-history-copy > p:not(.recorder-index) {
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: #aaa;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .recorder-close {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 700px;
    place-items: center;
    align-content: center;
    padding: 100px 38px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .recorder-close > div {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    color: var(--paper-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .recorder-close h2 {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: clamp(58px, 8vw, 112px);
    line-height: 0.88;
  }

  .recorder-close > a {
    margin-top: 42px;
  }

  .recorder-close footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: min(1000px, 100%);
    margin-top: 100px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    color: var(--paper-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .recorder-close footer p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .recorder-close footer nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .recorder-close footer a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }

  .recorder-close footer a:hover,
  .recorder-close footer a:focus-visible {
    color: var(--signal);
  }

  .recorder-close footer a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--signal);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .recorder-mobile-resource {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .recorder-hero,
    .recorder-assertions,
    .recorder-history > .recorder-wrap {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .recorder-hero > *,
    .recorder-assertions > *,
    .recorder-history > .recorder-wrap > * {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .recorder-assertions > header {
      position: static;
      max-width: 700px;
    }

    .recorder-check-table {
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .recorder-wrap {
      width: calc(100% - 40px);
    }

    .recorder-hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding-block: 68px 90px;
    }

    .recorder-copy h1 {
      font-size: clamp(46px, 12.5vw, 64px);
    }

    .recorder-terminal-output {
      min-height: 330px;
      padding: 20px 14px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      font-size: 10.5px;
    }

    .recorder-terminal-results .is-job {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 8px;
      min-width: 0;
      padding-left: 2ch;
    }

    .recorder-terminal-results .is-job > span {
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .recorder-terminal-results .is-job time {
      /* Durations are supplementary and intentionally omitted on narrow job rows. */
      display: none;
    }

    .recorder-terminal-details {
      min-width: 0;
      padding-left: 4ch;
    }

    .recorder-principle {
      padding-block: 85px 95px;
    }

    .recorder-principle-head {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .recorder-contract {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .recorder-contract > i {
      height: 28px;
      justify-content: start;
      font-size: 0;
      transform: none;
    }

    .recorder-contract > i::after {
      content: '↓';
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .recorder-contract article {
      padding-block: 20px;
    }

    .recorder-contract h3 {
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .recorder-assertions {
      padding-block: 90px 100px;
    }

